sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant V as Viewer (WASM)
  participant N as nginx :80
  participant S as app-server :8121
  V->>N: GET /api/dxf (Accept: x-msgpack, If-None-Match)
  N->>S: 전달
  S-->>V: MessagePack+LZ4 DxfSceneDto (또는 304)
  V->>N: POST /chathub/negotiate → WebSocket 전환
  par 1초마다
    V->>S: GET /api/Dock/status
    S-->>V: [nowMs, iso, [[dockId, devices, meta], ...]] (text/plain)
  and 2초마다
    V->>S: GET /api/ProcessCount/live/latest-n-minutes
    S-->>V: ProcessCountL[] (최근 5분 누적)
  and 1초마다
    V->>S: POST /api/EventLog/search/fast
    S-->>V: ApiResponse {data:{logs[], hasNextPage...}}
  and SignalR 푸시
    S--)V: Heartbeat (0.5초), ServerStatusReceived, CollectedCountReceived
  end
